# Design handoff bundles - reference material for a design pass, not shipped
# code. They used to be committed; that bloated the repo with binary zips
# nobody needs to clone to run the app. Kept on disk, just no longer tracked.
*.zip

# Internal dev history - session handoffs, audits, the original app plan, and
# the predecessor project's own history. Working notes for continuing
# development, not app content. Kept on disk for reference, never published,
# since this repo is meant to be shareable.
internal-history/
design-bundles/
